---
description:
  Nested subgraphs under the layered layout. Each cluster is sized by the engine around
  its content and title band, with edges crossing borders between levels.
config:
  layout: layered
---
flowchart TB
  start([Start]) --> a1
  subgraph outer [Outer service]
    subgraph inner [Inner worker]
      a1[Receive] --> a2{Valid?}
      a2 -->|yes| a3[Process]
    end
    a3 --> b1[Store]
    a2 -->|no| b2[Reject]
  end
  b1 --> done((Done))
  b2 --> done
